# Valgrind suppressions for YARS.
#
# Format: standard Valgrind suppression entries, one per `{}` block. See
# https://valgrind.org/docs/manual/manual-core.html#manual-core.suppress
#
# Activate via:
#   valgrind --suppressions=suppressions/valgrind.supp ./bin/yars ...
#
# Current state (2026-05-12): empty. The valgrind subset has not been executed
# yet — arm64 macOS has no upstream valgrind port. Pending the Linux CI runner
# from `add-linux-port-verification`, this file will collect Ogre/Bullet/Xerces
# noise so the YARS-attributable signal stays visible.
